# Builds the neko asset tools (SWF/Animate exporter). RunScript rebuilds
# scripts/tools.n with this file when it is missing.
#
# This fork's src/ only compiles for JS with -Dkixeye (KxRenderer imports
# js.*, and the native renderers reference DisplayObject fields Kixeye
# removed), so the tools compile against the fork's upstream base instead.
# The exported types (openfl._internal.symbols.*, formats.swf.*) are
# unchanged by Kixeye, so the output is the same.
#
# Requires branch haxe-4.3-migration-tools-base checked out next to this repo:
#   git worktree add ../openfl-tools-base haxe-4.3-migration-tools-base
-main Tools
-neko tools.n
-lib hxp
-lib lime
-lib format
-cp ../../openfl-tools-base/src
--macro openfl._internal.macros.ExtraParams.include()
-D lime-cairo
-D lime-cffi
-D optional-cffi
-D openfl
--remap flash:openfl
--no-inline
